{"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"remoteSource":{"fileName":"CurrentValueSubject.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject.swift#L36"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"CurrentValueSubject"}],"title":"CurrentValueSubject","modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CurrentValueSubject"}],"symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class","externalID":"s:7Afluent19CurrentValueSubjectC","role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CurrentValueSubject","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"Subscribing","level":2,"text":"Subscribing","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A consumer subscribes when its iterator is created, which is when a "},{"code":"for try await","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" loop over the subject"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(or over an operator chain built on it) begins. It first receives the value that is current at that moment,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"then every value sent afterwards, in order; values are buffered for it until it consumes them. Values sent"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before it subscribed are not replayed. A consumer that subscribes after completion receives only the completion."